    ("alias short commands st co", "`st=status -sb`! `co=switch`! `br=branch -vv`! `ci=commit -v`! `unstage=reset HEAD --`! — shorts typed (muscle memory!), status branched (context!), unstage safe (work kept!)."),
    ("alias undo reset soft", "`undo = reset --soft HEAD~1` keeps work (unstaged!); `redo`? none—reflog (`reset --hard ORIG_HEAD`!) — soft undoes (work kept!), reflog rescues (hashes!), hard deliberate (loss!)."),
    ("alias amend fixup autosquash", "`amend = commit --amend --no-edit`! `fixup = commit --fixup`! `ri = rebase -i --autosquash`! — fixups stack (autosquash orders!), amends quick (typos!), interactive rebases (history clean!)."),
