    ("hook pre-commit lint format", "pre-commit (lint! format check! tests fast! `STAGED_FILES`!) blocks bad commits locally; frameworks (`pre-commit` repos!) version hooks — hooks block (bad stopped!), staged scoped (index!), frameworks share (team!)."),
    ("hook commit-msg lint", "commit-msg (`commitlint --edit $1`! conventional check! ticket refs!) enforces messages; `--no-verify` escapes (rare!) — messages linted (conventional!), tickets linked (trace!), bypasses rare (audited!)."),
