    ("recipe diff stat review", "`diff --stat` (files+lines!) + `--dirstat` (dirs!) + `--summary` (renames/modes!) scope reviews; `--check` whitespace — stats scope (sizes!), dirs roll up (areas!), checks catch (whitespace!)."),
    ("recipe blame ignore revs", "`blame --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs` skips formatting (LICENSES!); `--ignore-rev` one-offs — revs ignored (format hidden!), history true (authors!), file versioned (team!)."),
