    ("usestate basics updates", "`const [n, setN] = useState(0)` declares state; updater forms (`setN(n => n+1)` safe queued!) avoid stale; lazy init (`useState(() => heavy())` once!) — updaters functional (queued!), lazy inits (once!), state minimal (derived computed!)."),
    ("useeffect basics deps", "`useEffect(() => { fetch(); return () => abort(); }, [id])` syncs outside React (fetch! subscriptions!); deps array controls reruns (exhaustive-deps lint!) — effects sync (external!), cleanups unsubscribe (leaks dead!), deps complete (lint enforced!)."),
