    ("events synthetic handlers", "Handlers (`onClick={e => del(id)}`! `onChange` inputs! `onSubmit` forms! `e.preventDefault()`!) wrap synthetic events (pooled legacy! persisted modern!) — handlers inline (closures!), defaults prevented (forms!), events delegated (root!)."),
    ("controlled inputs forms", "Controlled (`value={v} onChange={e => setV(e.target.value)}`) makes React source of truth (validation! formatting!); one state per field (or object!) — controlled validates (instant!), sources single (state!), changes handled (every key!)."),
    ("useref dom mutable", "`useRef` holds DOM (`ref={inputRef}` + `inputRef.current.focus()`!) and mutable boxes (timers! counts! no rerender!) — refs imperatively touch (focus!), boxes persist (renders!), nulls checked (mounts!)."),
    ("usecontext provider basics", "`createContext` + `<Ctx.Provider value={v}>` + `useContext(Ctx)` shares without prop drilling (theme! auth!); value memoized (rerenders!) — contexts share (deep trees!), providers wrap (subtrees!), values memoized (renders bounded!)."),
    ("usereducer actions dispatch", "`useReducer(reducer, init)` manages transitions (`dispatch({type:'add', id})`! switch reducers! init functions!) — reducers centralize (logic!), actions describe (intent!), complex state tamed (forms!)."),
    ("usememo expensive derived", "`useMemo(() => heavy(list), [list])` caches derivations (sorts! filters!); deps honest (stale bugs!) — memos cache (recomputes!), deps listed (fresh!), measured (not premature!)."),
    ("usecallback stable handlers", "`useCallback(fn, [deps])` stabilizes callbacks for memoized children (props equality!); inline otherwise (overhead!) — callbacks stable (children skip!), deps tracked (fresh closures!), used deliberately (props!)."),
    ("custom hooks extract reuse", "Custom hooks (`useFetch(url)`! `use` prefix! call other hooks!) share stateful logic (no HOCs!); rules apply (top-level!) — hooks extract (logic reuse!), prefixed (lint!), composed (primitives!)."),
    ("fragments shorthand keys", "Fragments (`<>...</>` groups! `<Fragment key={id}>` keyed lists!) avoid wrapper divs (DOM clean!); keys need long form — fragments group (no DOM!), keyed long-form (lists!), shorthand simple (static!)."),
