    ("proptypes defaultprops check", "PropTypes (`string.isRequired`! `shape`! `arrayOf`!) runtime-check in dev; TS preferred (`interface Props`!); defaults destructure — types document (contracts!), dev warn (mistakes!), TS static (better!)."),
