    ("tsconfig references paths", "Monorepo TS (`references`! `paths: {'@ui/*'}`! `composite`! `tsc -b`!) links packages (editor jumps!); bundler aliases mirror — referenced projects (builds!), pathed aliases (imports!), built composite (fast!)."),
    ("changesets versioning releases", "Changesets (`.md` minor/patch! `changeset version` bumps! CI publish! changelogs!) versions monorepos (per package!); linked groups share versions — changeseted intents (files!), versioned bumps (semver!), published CI (provenance!)."),
    ("storybook stories controls msw", "Storybook (`*.stories.js`! args/controls! MSW addon! `play` interactions! Chromatic visual!) develops isolated (edge cases!); docs auto — storied states (variants!), controlled args (knobs!), played tests (interactions!)."),
    ("fix infinite loop effect", "Effect loops (`setState` in effect with changing dep! `setList([...list])` new ref every render!) fixed by functional updates (`setL(prev => ...)`) or correct deps (primitive ids!) — looped setters (deps!), functionaled updates (prev!), deped primitives (ids!)."),
    ("fix stale closure timeout", "Stale closures (timeouts/intervals capture old state! event handlers frozen!) fixed by refs mirror (`ref.current = state`!) or functional updates; deps arrays include — closed stale (captures!), mirrored refs (current!), updated functional (queues!)."),
    ("fix exhaustive deps warning", "`exhaustive-deps` warnings fixed by adding deps (functions memoized! objects memoized!) or moving inside effect (fetch fns!); disable per-line rarely — deped complete (fresh!), memoized callbacks (stable!), moved inside (locals!)."),
    ("fix useless memo unstable", "`memo` useless when props unstable (inline objects! arrow handlers!) — stabilize first (`useMemo`/`useCallback`!) or drop memo (overhead!); profiler proves — stabilized props (memos work!), dropped premature (cost!), profiled proof (commits!)."),
    ("fix context rerender all", "All consumers rerender on any context change — split contexts (state/actions separate!) or selectors (`useContextSelector`!) or external store (zustand!) — splitted contexts (granular!), selected slices (renders!), stored external (global!)."),
    ("fix strict double effect", "Double effects in dev (StrictMode intentional!) — make effects idempotent (cleanup aborts! guards `ignore` flag!) not delete StrictMode; prod single — idempotented cleanups (aborts!), guarded flags (ignore!), kept strict (bugs surface!)."),
    ("fix batching async updates", "Multiple `setState` batch (one render!); need latest? functional updates chain (`setN(n => n+1)` twice = +2!) or `flushSync` escape (rare!) — batched renders (one!), chained functional (queues!), flushed rarely (sync!)."),
    ("fix derived state antipattern", "State mirroring props desyncs — derive during render (`const full = first + last`!) or `key` remount (user change!) or effect sync (rare documented!) — derived renders (computed!), keyed remounts (fresh!), synced effects (rare!)."),
    ("fix controlled uncontrolled warn", "Switching controlled↔uncontrolled warns — initialize (`useState(value ?? '')`! `defaultValue` xor `value`!) one mode per lifetime; null→'' guards — initialized defined (strings!), XORed modes (one!), guarded nulls (empties!)."),
    ("fix input loses focus remount", "Focus loss means remount (inline component definitions! `key` changes! conditional types swap!) — hoist components (module scope!) stabilize keys (ids!) keep types (same!) — hoisted definitions (stable!), keyed stable (identity!), typed same (no swap!)."),
    ("fix reorder state mismatch", "Reordered inputs keep wrong state — index keys culprit; stable ids fix (db keys!); `key={item.id}` everywhere — IDed stable (reorders!), indexed never (dynamic!), keyed items (identity!)."),
    ("fix fragment key map", "Keys on `<>` impossible — use `<Fragment key={id}>` long form in mapped lists (sections!); shorthand static only — fragmented keyed (long!), mapped lists (keys!), shorted static (no keys!)."),
    ("fix setstate stale queue", "Sequential `setN(n+1); setN(n+1)` yields +1 (same snapshot!) — functional form queues (`setN(p => p+1)` twice = +2!); same for objects — functionaled queues (+2!), snapshotted stale (+1!), queued updates (order!)."),
    ("fix mutate state spread", "Mutating state (`obj.x = 1`! `arr.push`!) skips renders — copy (`{...o, x: 1}`! `[...a, x]`! nested spreads!) or Immer drafts — copied spreads (new refs!), drafted immer (mutable syntax!), nested copied (paths!)."),
    ("fix nested update immer", "Deep updates verbose (`{...s, a: {...s.a, b: {...s.a.b, c}}}}`) — Immer `produce` simplifies (mutable drafts!); normalized flattens (ids!) — produced drafts (mutable!), spread nested (manual!), normalized flat (tables!)."),
    ("fix form rerender keystroke", "Whole form rerenders per keystroke (lifted state! no memo!) — uncontrolled + RHF (refs!) or split components (field-level state!) or debounced — uncontrolled fast (refs!), splitted fields (local!), debounced saves (typing!)."),
    ("fix cursor jump format", "Cursor jumps when formatting controlled inputs (rebuilt value! length changes!) — format onBlur (not change!) or track selection (`setSelectionRange` restore!) — blurred formats (stable!), tracked selection (restore!), changed raw (typing!)."),
    ("fix select value default", "`value` without `onChange` locks select (read-only warn!) — controlled pair (state!) or `defaultValue` uncontrolled; placeholder option (`value=''` disabled!) — paired controlled (state!), defaulted uncontrolled (initial!), optioned placeholder (hints!)."),
    ("fix checkbox group array", "Multi-checkbox binds array (`checked={sel.includes(v)}` toggle add/remove!) not boolean; radio single value — arrayed multi (toggles!), booleaned single (checked!), valued radios (groups!)."),
    ("fix radio checked compare", "Radios need `checked={val === opt}` + shared `name` + `onChange` set; uncontrolled `defaultChecked` once — compared checked (equality!), named groups (exclusive!), changed set (state!)."),
    ("fix file input reset", "File inputs reset via `e.target.value = ''` or `key` remount (controlled impossible!); same-file reselect needs clear — valued empty (clears!), keyed remounts (fresh!), controlled never (readonly!)."),
    ("fix double submit fire", "Double submits (StrictMode dev! impatient clicks!) — disable while pending (`useFormStatus`! `isPending`!) + idempotency keys server; Enter+click both — disabled pending (buttons!), keyed idempotent (server!), handled once (guards!)."),
    ("fix hydration date random", "Mismatches from `Date.now()`/`Math.random()`/locale differ — render dynamic client-only (`useEffect` mount gate! `suppressHydrationWarning` text!) or deterministic SSR — gated mounts (client!), warned suppress (text!), determined server (same!)."),
    ("fix window undefined ssr", "`window`/`document`/`localStorage` crash SSR — guard (`typeof window !== 'undefined'`!) or effect-only (mount!) or dynamic import `ssr:false` — guarded typeof (server!), effected mounts (client!), imported dynamic (islands!)."),
    ("fix layouteffect ssr warn", "`useLayoutEffect` warns on server (no-op!) — `useIsomorphicLayoutEffect` pattern (client layout! server effect!) silences; measure client-only — isomorphic switches (env!), measured client (DOM!), silenced warns (SSR!)."),
    ("fix localstorage ssr init", "Reading storage during SSR crashes — lazy `useState(() => read())` client (mounts!) or try/catch guards; JSON parse failures default — lazied init (mount!), guarded try (parse!), defaulted fallback (corrupt!)."),
    ("fix matchmedia ssr default", "`matchMedia` absent server — default snapshot (`getServerSnapshot: () => false`!) + `useSyncExternalStore` hydrates; CSS first — defaulted server (snapshot!), synced external (store!), CSSed first (styles!)."),
    ("fix title ssr helmet", "Title flashes on SSR nav — Next `metadata` per route (server!) or Helmet async (deferred!); loading states title too — metadataed routes (server!), helmeted async (client!), titled loads (states!)."),
    ("fix suspense stuck fallback", "Stuck fallback = promise never settles (missing await! thrown non-promise! cache miss loop!) — `use()` cached promises (deduped!) + error boundary sibling — settled promises (resolve!), cached dedupe (requests!), bounded errors (siblings!)."),
    ("fix lazy default interop", "`lazy()` needs default export — named? re-export (`export default`) or wrapper module (`{ default } from named`!); types `LazyExoticComponent` — defaulted exports (lazy!), wrapped named (interop!), typed exotic (TS!)."),
    ("fix boundary reset keys", "Boundary stays crashed after fix — `resetKeys={[userId]}` + `onReset` remounts (fresh try!); location key (routes!) — keyed resets (retry!), reset callbacks (state!), located routes (nav!)."),
    ("fix boundary misses events", "Boundaries miss event handlers/async (only render/lifecycle!) — try/catch + local error state (`setErr`! throw in render to trigger!) — caught handlers (try!), stated errors (local!), thrown renders (trigger!)."),
    ("fix async error boundary", "Async errors skip boundaries — `useErrorBoundary` hook or `throw` stored error in render (`if (err) throw err`!) routes to boundary — hooked errors (libs!), thrown stored (renders!), routed boundaries (UI!)."),
    ("fix chunk load version skew", "Chunk 404s after deploy (old HTML! new hashes!) — retry once (`window.location.reload`! error boundary reset!) + long cache immutable; service worker updates — retried reloads (fresh!), hashed immutable (cache!), versioned deploys (atomic!)."),
    ("fix missing sourcemaps prod", "Minified prod stacks unreadable — upload sourcemaps (Sentry! `hidden-source-map`!) without serving publicly; releases tag — mapped hidden (private!), uploaded CI (traces!), released versions (match!)."),
    ("fix env undefined client", "Client env undefined — prefix required (`VITE_`! `NEXT_PUBLIC_`!) + restart dev (loaded once!) + rebuild (baked!); server secrets unprefixed — prefixed expose (clients!), restarted loads (dev!), baked builds (static!)."),
    ("fix cors fetch proxy", "CORS blocks (`No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin'`!) — server headers (credentials+origin!) or dev proxy (`vite server.proxy`! Next rewrites!) or same-origin route handlers — headered server (CORS!), proxied dev (rewrites!), routed same-origin (handlers!)."),
    ("fix image 404 base path", "Images 404 on subpath deploys — `basePath`/`assetPrefix` set (Next!) + absolute `/img` breaks (relative!); `loader` custom (CDN!) — pathed base (subpaths!), prefixed assets (CDN!), loaded custom (hosts!)."),
    ("fix font fout cls", "Font swap shifts layout (FOUT/CLS!) — `font-display: optional` + preload + fallback metrics (`size-adjust`!) match; self-host (no CDN!) — displayed swap (text!), preloaded critical (early!), adjusted metrics (fallback!)."),
    ("fix lcp hero priority", "Slow LCP (hero lazy! unsized! unprioritized!) — `priority` + `fetchpriority='high'` + preload + sized (no shift!); CDN serve — prioritized heroes (fetch!), sized boxes (CLS!), preloaded critical (discovery!)."),
    ("fix cls skeleton size", "Layout shift from late content (images! ads! fonts!) — reserve space (aspect-ratio! skeletons same size! dimensions!) CLS < 0.1 — reserved ratios (boxes!), skeletoned same (placeholders!), dimensioned media (attrs!)."),
    ("fix inp laggy transition", "Slow INP (main-thread work on input! heavy renders!) — transitions defer (`startTransition`!) + memo lists + web workers compute — transitioned heavy (background!), memoed lists (skips!), worked threads (compute!)."),
    ("fix moment lodash bloat", "Bundle bloated (moment locales! `lodash` full! barrel icons!) — `date-fns`/`dayjs` replace + `lodash-es` named + deep icon imports — replaced light (date!), named cherry (tree-shake!), deep imported (icons!)."),
    ("fix barrel icon imports", "Barrel (`import {X} from 'lib'`) pulls all — deep paths (`lib/X`!) or per-icon packages; analyzer verifies — pathed deep (singles!), barreled never (all!), analyzed proof (treemap!)."),
    ("fix parent rerender memo", "Memo child still renders (parent recreates props! context changed! key changed!) — stable props (callbacks!) + split (state down!) + why-did-you-render — stabled callbacks (equal!), splitted state (local!), diagnosed WDYR (cause!)."),
    ("fix inline object props", "Inline objects (`style={{...}}`! `options={{}}`!) break memo every render — hoist constants (module!) or `useMemo` (deps!) — hoisted constants (stable!), memoized deps (fresh!), inlined never (memo!)."),
    ("fix context object literal", "`value={{user, setUser}}` new ref each render — memoize (`useMemo(() => ({...}), [user])`!) or split; provider up high — memoized values (stable!), splitted providers (scope!), hoisted state (down!)."),
    ("fix selector rerender redux", "Selector rerenders (new object refs! `useSelector(s => s.a.b)` granular! `shallowEqual`!) — selected granular (leaves!), equalled shallow (objects!), memoized reselect (derived!)."),
    ("fix zustand subscribe slice", "Zustand over-renders (whole store selected!) — selectors per field (`useS(s => s.x)`!) + transient (no subscribe!) + actions separate — selected fields (slices!), transiented scratch (refs!), separated actions (stable!)."),
    ("fix query key unstable", "Refetch loops from object keys (`['t', {f}]` new ref!) — primitive keys (`['t', f]`!) + stable arrays + `queryKeyHashFn` custom — keyed primitives (stable!), arrayed order (params!), hashed custom (objects!)."),
    ("fix mutation stale invalidate", "UI stale post-mutation (cache untouched!) — `onSuccess: invalidateQueries` (keys!) or optimistic `setQueryData` + rollback — invalidated keys (refetch!), setted optimistic (instant!), rolled back errors (truth!)."),
    ("fix optimistic rollback revert", "Optimistic stuck wrong (no rollback! context lost!) — `onMutate` snapshot + `onError` restore + `onSettled` invalidate — snapshotted mutate (prev!), restored error (rollback!), settled invalidate (truth!)."),
    ("fix fetch race abort", "Race (slow earlier overwrites later!) — `AbortController` per effect (cleanup aborts!) or ignore-if-stale (`id` compare!) — aborted cleanups (cancels!), IDed requests (latest!), ignored stale (guards!)."),
    ("fix search overwrite id", "Search shows old results (out-of-order!) — request ids (`++ref` latest wins!) or `useDeferredValue` (consistent!) — IDed latest (wins!), deferred consistent (pairs!), aborted previous (cancel!)."),
    ("fix act warning async", "`act(...)` warnings (state outside test flow! async unsettled!) — `findBy` waits (async!) + `userEvent` awaits + `waitFor` asserts — found async (waits!), awaited users (events!), asserted waitFor (eventual!)."),
    ("fix rtl multiple elements", "`getBy` throws on multiples (ambiguous!) — `getAllBy` arrays (count!) or `queryBy` null-safe (absent!) or scoped `within` — alled arrays (multi!), queried null (absent!), withined scope (sections!)."),
    ("fix userevent await setup", "userEvent v14 needs `await user.click` (`user.setup()` instance!); fireEvent sync legacy — awaited interactions (async!), setup instances (per test!), fired sync (legacy!)."),
    ("fix cypress mount vs e2e", "Cypress E2E slow for components — component testing mounts (`mount(<C/>)`! same API!) isolates; E2E flows only — mounted units (fast!), E2Eed flows (critical!), shared commands (helpers!).")
