    ("group accumulators sum avg", "`$group` accumulators (`$sum`! `$avg`! `$min/$max`! `$push`! `$addToSet`! `$first/$last` sorted!) summarize; `_id: null` whole — summed counts (totals!), averaged means (stats!), pushed arrays (lists!)."),
    ("project shape computed", "`$project: {name:1, total: {$multiply:['$p','$q']}}` reshapes (include/exclude/computed!); `_id: 0` drops — projected shapes (fields!), computed expressions (derived!), dropped ids (lean!)."),
    ("pipeline sort limit paging", "`{$sort:{d:-1}}, {$skip:20}, {$limit:10}` pages in-pipe (indexes sort!); `$sort+$limit` coalesce (top-k!) — sorted indexed (orders!), limited tops (k!), skipped deep (slow!)."),
    ("lookup join foreign local", "`$lookup: {from:'users', localField:'uid', foreignField:'_id', as:'u'}` joins (left outer! arrays!); `$unwind` flattens — looked up collections (joins!), ased arrays (nested!), unwound flat (rows!)."),
    ("unwind preserve null empty", "`$unwind: {path:'$tags', preserveNullAndEmptyArrays:true}` explodes (per element!); `includeArrayIndex` numbers — unwound elements (rows!), preserved empties (nulls!), indexed positions (orders!)."),
