    ("bucket auto ranges groups", "`$bucket/$bucketAuto: {groupBy:'$price', buckets:5}` histograms (ranges! auto quantiles! `default` other!) — bucketed ranges (histograms!), autoed quantiles (even!), defaulted other (leftovers!)."),
