    ("createIndex single field", "`createIndex({email: 1})` accelerates equality/sort (B-tree! selective first!); background builds (prod!) — indexed fields (queries!), treed B (ordered!), built background (live!)."),
    ("compound order esr rule", "Compound ESR (equality! sort! range!) orders (`{s:1, d:-1, p:{$gte}}`! prefixes share!) — equalled first (filters!), sorted middle (orders!), ranged last (bounds!)."),
