    ("empty table state", "Zero rows? Render one `<tr><td colspan='3'>Tiada rekod.</td></tr>` — empty states explicit, not blank confusion."),
    ("form get post", "`method='get'` exposes data in URL (searches, bookmarkable); `post` hides bodies (mutations, files) — verbs carry semantics."),
