    ("semisync lossless tuning", "`rpl_semi_sync_master_enabled` + `rpl_semi_sync_master_wait_point=AFTER_SYNC` (lossless! slower!) vs AFTER_COMMIT (faster, tiny loss!); `rpl_semi_sync_master_timeout` fallback async — wait-point chosen (lossless vs latency!), timeouts fallback (availability!), acks monitored (replica health!)."),
