    ("array_filter map", "`array_filter`/`array_map` transform functionally; `ARRAY_FILTER_USE_BOTH` passes keys too."),
    ("usort spaceship", "`usort($a, fn($x,$y) => $x <=> $y)` sorts customly; `<=>` chains multi-key comparators elegantly."),
