    ("mb_ functions", "`mb_strlen/mb_substr/mb_strtolower` handle UTF-8 (Malay/Jawi text!); byte functions mangle multibyte silently."),
    ("date DateTime", "`new DateTimeImmutable('now', new DateTimeZone('Asia/Kuala_Lumpur'))` — immutable + explicit zones end DST double-counting."),
